[new branch] practical-2 -&gt; practical-2</code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">practical-2</code> branch is now pushed to GitHub with the shared shell on all 5 pages. GitHub even shows you a link to open a pull request later — no need to do that yet, we'll do it at the very end after all activities are done (per the manual's Part H).</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr"><strong>Checkpoint reached: Part A + Part B fully done.</strong> 🎉</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Now — Part C: Home page content (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">index.html</code>)</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">We'll add:</p>
<ul dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">A welcome section with heading, paragraph (with <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;strong&gt;</code>, <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;em&gt;</code>, <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;span&gt;</code>)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">A campus image</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">A "Find Us" section with an embedded map (iframe)</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr"><strong>About the image</strong> — do you have a photo of your college campus you want to use, or should we use a free stock/placeholder photo for now? Let me know and I'll adjust the <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;img src="..."&gt;</code> path accordingly. If you don't have one ready, we can use a placeholder online image link so you can move forward now and swap in your own photo later.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ml-0.5 -mt-1"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="_r_i7_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" tabindex="0" fdprocessedid="9czde"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[