cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 533.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="max-w-[85%]"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="37" data-index="37" data-testid="transcript-row" data-last-message="true" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="0" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="38" aria-posinset="38" aria-label="Message 38 of 38"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]" style="" data-is-streaming="false"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: Great, thanks for these!</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 [&amp;_&gt;_*:last-child]:mb-0 print:block print:[&amp;_&gt;_:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Great, thanks for these! Let's set them up properly.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">About your files</h3>
<ol dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Campus photo</strong> (the one you uploaded) — we'll save this as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">campus.jpg</code> inside your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media</code> folder</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>MP3 file</strong> (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">alex_kizenkov-dark-engine-logo-141942.mp3</code>) — this is great for later, we'll use it in <strong>Part D (Gallery — audio)</strong> as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media/jingle.mp3</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Lhosar image link</strong> — that URL is a <strong>Google Images search redirect link</strong>, not a direct image file, so it won't work as an <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;img src="..."&gt;</code>. Best to skip it for now — we already have your real campus photo which is exactly what the manual asks for (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media/campus.jpg</code>). We can add more images later in Part D if you want.</li>
</ol>
<h3 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1 — Save the campus photo into your project</h3>
<ol dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save the campus photo you uploaded to your computer (if not already saved) — right-click it → <strong>Save image as...</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Rename it to exactly: <strong><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">campus.jpg</code></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">In VS Code, drag-and-drop that <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">campus.jpg</code> file directly into the <strong><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media</code></strong> folder in the Explorer sidebar (left panel)</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr"><em>(Alternative if drag-and-drop is awkward: open File Explorer on Windows, navigate to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Desktop\class\events_hub\media</code>, and paste the image file there directly.)</em></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">📸 Send me a screenshot once <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">campus.jpg</code> appears inside the <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media</code> folder in VS Code's Explorer.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2 — Save the MP3 too (while we're at it)</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Same idea — copy your mp3 file into the <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media</code> folder and rename it to: <strong><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">jingle.mp3</code></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">We won't use it until Part D, but let's get it in place now so it's ready.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">📸 Include that in the same screenshot if possible (both <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">campus.jpg</code> and <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">jingle.mp3</code> inside <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">media</code>).</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Once confirmed, I'll give you the <strong>Part C copy-paste code</strong> for <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">index.html</code>'s welcome section + map.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ml-0.5 -mt-1"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="_r_kt_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" tabindex="0" fdprocessedid="l5vid"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-p